BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Sing-A-Long of Old School Hymns mixed in with Cheesy Love Songs from all decades! Sing Like No One's Listening! General Admission $ 10. Limited Vip Table Options. Tickets in web link or search "Beer and Hymns Cheesy Love Songs" in EventBrite.\nBeer and Hymns is a sing-along event! Come sing your favorite hymns and pop hits from every decade—with voices strong and glasses raised!\nAbout Beer and Hymns Northern Colorado:Music is good for the soul! Beer and Hymns is a casual gathering for all people who love the idea of singing old-school songs of hope mixed with favorite pop tunes—all while enjoying quality craft beer (or soda\, if that’s your thing). Join us and “Sing Like No One's Listening!”\nYou can bring your own food to this event: Your favorite\, pizza\, burgers etc. or even just snacks. ALL BEVERAGES must be purchased from our host Bootstrap Brewing.\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/beer-and-hymns-cheesy-love-songs-edition
DTEND:20260216T030000Z
LOCATION:Bootstrap Brewing
DTSTART:20260216T010000Z
SUMMARY:🎵 [R&B] Beer and Hymns "Cheesy Love Songs" Edition!
UID:c4b4525c-0f5c-4e8c-8158-1366497fa673@c4b4.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:💖✨ Valentine’s Day 80s Prom ✨💖\nGet ready to rewind the clock and dance the night away at our totally rad Valentine’s Day 80s Prom! Break out the big hair\, neon looks\, and classic prom fits as we celebrate love—retro style. Whether you’re coming with a date\, your besties\, or flying solo\, this is an in-person party you won’t want to miss.\nLIVE MUSIC BY 5280 BAND!\n5280s Band is Denver’s freshest 80s party band\, bringing the sights and sounds of the MTV-era to life. Dressed in retro flair and performing a non-stop mix of rock anthems\, pop hits\, and new wave favorites\, the 5280s Band delivers a high-energy flashback that will have you dancing\, singing along\, and pumping your fist to the most radical tunes of the 1980s!\n🪩 What’s included:\n• A photobooth for all guests\n• A rose stem at every seated place setting\n• Elegant Decor with Tablecloths at the tables (Tables included for VIP and Seated guests\, not GA Standing)\n• Prizes for many things!\n• Nonstop 80s vibes\, dancing\, and throwback tunes\n🍽️ Food & Drinks:\n• A food menu will be available for purchase during the event\n• Full bar available all night\n• Looking for dinner before the dance? Enjoy seated dining in the restaurant below\, The Passenger\, before heading upstairs to prom\n⭐ VIP Perks:\n• Mix & mingle with the band\n• Exclusive photobooth photos with the band\n• Table Seating\n📸 Photo Add-On:\nNon-VIP guests can purchase a $5 add-on for post-show photos with the band (VIPs included automatically).\nDress to impress\, grab a drink\, strike a pose\, and make this Valentine’s Day one for the history books. 💕🕺💃\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/valentines-day-80s-prom-with-live-band-and-dj
DTEND:20260215T053000Z
LOCATION:Dickens Opera House
DTSTART:20260215T020000Z
SUMMARY:🎵 [Rock] Valentine's Day 80's Prom with LIVE BAND & DJ!
UID:04c7f3e2-b26d-408c-96de-bfb9d45396c4@04c7.org
END:VEVENT
